agm-0983: AGM H6 Wi-Fi step 3 (bsd/dev/agm_wcn_sipc.c): Wi-Fi command layer over the sblock channel 7:
SYNC_VERSION, DOWNLOAD_INI (bsd/dev/agm_wifi_ini.h: this phone's wifi_board_config.ini through the vendor's
rf_marlin3.c parser, agm-h6/wcn/inigen), GET_INFO (MAC), OPEN (station), SCAN; prints the networks heard.

diff --git a/bsd/dev/agm_wcn_sipc.c b/bsd/dev/agm_wcn_sipc.c
